{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/00_Banner_Welcome.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Invasion Survivors</strong>, you fight to survive endless enemy hordes. Choose a character, pick a weapon, and set the difficulty. Each run has 20 waves, lasting 20 to 70 seconds, getting harder over time. The final wave has a powerful boss\u2014defeat it to unlock new rewards, weapons, items, and characters.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Stand.gif?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/ARABESCO4.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/05_Banner_Characters.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How many playable characters will there be in <i>Invasion Survivors</i>? <i>Yes</i>.<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Character_Selection.gif?t=1742087124\" /><strong><i><u> </u></i></strong><br><br><br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Gameplay_1.gif?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/ARABESCO5.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/06_Banner_Weapons.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons will be diverse and split into categories like projectile, <strong>melee, tech, elemental, explosion, and magic</strong>. Some will even fit into multiple categories, adding even more variety to gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll find everything from traditional weapons like axes and shotguns to wackier ones like magic ponies and homing mother\u2019s slippers, making combat both chaotic and fun.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Weapons_2.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Gameplay_2.gif?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/ARABESCO5.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/07_Banner_Items.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There will be over<strong> 300</strong> different items across multiple tiers: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Legendary, and Mythic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features around <strong>20</strong> primary stats and over <strong>20</strong> secondary stats, with items covering all possible attribute combinations. On top of that, there will be unique items across various tiers that provide powerful upgrades, allowing for even crazier builds and gameplay possibilities.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Items.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Shop1.gif?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/ARABESCO5.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong> </strong></i></u><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/01_Banner_Story.png?t=1742087124\" /><u><i><strong></strong></i></u><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, <strong>Potato</strong>, a highly advanced alien robot with an <strong>unknown origin</strong>, steps out of a portal and appears right in front of you. Moments later, an <strong>alien invasion</strong> begins. Desperate, you start running, carrying this small and adorable robot. Luckily, it starts helping you fight off the enemies, and now you have no choice but to team up with it to face the invasion and return to your peaceful life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Items_1.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575500?t=1742087124","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/2b75f3e1b15670c81554e63e3558496c898c8df2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742087124","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/92b56e5a3403bc05a1f138c3c009a498c8e4c583/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742087124","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/92b56e5a3403bc05a1f138c3c009a498c8e4c583/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742087124","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/00_Banner_Welcome.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Invasion Survivors</strong>, you fight to survive endless enemy hordes. Choose a character, pick a weapon, and set the difficulty. Each run has 20 waves, lasting 20 to 70 seconds, getting harder over time. The final wave has a powerful boss\u2014defeat it to unlock new rewards, weapons, items, and characters.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Stand.gif?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/ARABESCO4.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/05_Banner_Characters.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How many playable characters will there be in <i>Invasion Survivors</i>? <i>Yes</i>.<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Character_Selection.gif?t=1742087124\" /><strong><i><u> </u></i></strong><br><br><br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Gameplay_1.gif?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/ARABESCO5.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/06_Banner_Weapons.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons will be diverse and split into categories like projectile, <strong>melee, tech, elemental, explosion, and magic</strong>. Some will even fit into multiple categories, adding even more variety to gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll find everything from traditional weapons like axes and shotguns to wackier ones like magic ponies and homing mother\u2019s slippers, making combat both chaotic and fun.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Weapons_2.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Gameplay_2.gif?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/ARABESCO5.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/07_Banner_Items.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There will be over<strong> 300</strong> different items across multiple tiers: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Legendary, and Mythic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features around <strong>20</strong> primary stats and over <strong>20</strong> secondary stats, with items covering all possible attribute combinations. On top of that, there will be unique items across various tiers that provide powerful upgrades, allowing for even crazier builds and gameplay possibilities.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Items.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Shop1.gif?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/ARABESCO5.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong> </strong></i></u><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/01_Banner_Story.png?t=1742087124\" /><u><i><strong></strong></i></u><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, <strong>Potato</strong>, a highly advanced alien robot with an <strong>unknown origin</strong>, steps out of a portal and appears right in front of you. Moments later, an <strong>alien invasion</strong> begins. Desperate, you start running, carrying this small and adorable robot. Luckily, it starts helping you fight off the enemies, and now you have no choice but to team up with it to face the invasion and return to your peaceful life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/Items_1.png?t=1742087124\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Boss Wave Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/544344a7dde95dd32c44fa51b4c078396f6b843f/header.jpg?t=1742087124","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112799,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112799/movie480.mp4?t=1741719784","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112799/movie_max.mp4?t=1741719784"},"name":"Invasion Survivors - Official Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112799/f9330d383feac08d7b2b8022c35ec0418501a204/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741719784","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112799/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741719784","max":"http:/