rvive challenging waves of enemies, choosing from a variety of weapons and characters to create your own way to battle invading alien hordes.","steam_appid":3575500,"support_info":{"email":"invasionsurvivors@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Spain","type":"game","website":null}